OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFreshers offered meningitis jabs
OL,4,Aon campus
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirst-year university students in the
OL,7,FSouth East are being offered meningitis
OL,8,FB vaccinations on campus as part of an
OL,9,FNHS drive to boost protection against
OL,10,Fthe disease.
OL,12,FClinics are being held during Freshers
OL,13,FWeek at universities including Surrey,
OL,14,FKent and Chichester, with thousands of
OL,15,Fstudents eligible for free
OL,16,Fvaccinations.
OL,18,FThe campaign comes months after more
OL,19,Fthan 20 young people, mostly students,
OL,20,Fwere infected during a severe outbreak
OL,21,Fof meningitis B in Kent.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
