OL,3,GNEWSAFreshers offered meningitis jabs
OL,4,Aon campus
OL,5,
OL,6,FUniversity of Surrey student Arwen, who
OL,7,Freceived her jab on Friday, said: "I
OL,8,Fwanted to get vaccinated today because
OL,9,FI will be starting my course next week
OL,10,Fand I know it's really important for me
OL,11,Fto stay safe."
